closes
.SS Links
.TP
.B L
the note's
.B [[wiki links]]
and the notes linking to it, under a search box;
.B enter
follows. A missing note is offered for creation. Backlinks read at most 200
candidates per search (Notes and Archive), and say so when the list may be
